@startuml netmech_overview
' NetMechanism 分层总览（全景，不含成员细节）
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam ArrowColor #5B6B7B
skinparam ClassBorderColor #7A8B9A
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #F7F9FB
skinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor #E8EEF4
skinparam InterfaceBackgroundColor #EFF6EC
skinparam InterfaceBorderColor #6E9C5A

title NetMechanism 分层总览\n<size:11>L0 调用方 / L1 公共契约 / L2 内部实现 / L3 基础设施</size>

package "L0 调用方（应用侧自行实现）" as L0 #F2F5F8 {
    interface Linkable
    interface IoHandler
    interface SessionHandler
}

package "L1 公共契约（include/netmech，13 头）" as L1 #EFF6EC {
    class Mechanism
    class Endpoint
    interface IDatagramChannel
    interface IDatagramReceiver
    class "Mechanism::Config" as MechConfig <<struct>>
    class ReceiverConfig <<struct>>
    class DatagramConfig <<struct>>
    class KeepAliveParams <<struct>>
}

package "L2 内部实现（src，不对外暴露）" as L2 #FBF7F7 {
    class "Mechanism::Impl" as MechanismImpl
    class "Endpoint::Impl" as EndpointImpl
    class Acceptor
    class UdpChannel
    class DatagramReceiver
    class DatagramSession
}

package "L3 基础设施与错误" as L3 #F6F6FA {
    class IoPool
    class "detail::IdRegistry" as IdRegistry
    enum NetErrc
    enum DatagramErrc
}

' ---- 层间关系 ----
L0 ..> L1 : 实现回调接口\n注册到门面
L1 *--> L2 : Pimpl 持有\n工厂创建
L2 ..> L3 : 线程池 / ID 分配 / 错误码

' ---- 层内关键关系 ----
Linkable -right-> Mechanism : listen/connect
IoHandler -right-> Endpoint : on_init 产出
SessionHandler -right-> IDatagramReceiver : 会话事件
Mechanism *-right- MechanismImpl
Endpoint *-right- EndpointImpl
IDatagramChannel <|-- UdpChannel
IDatagramReceiver <|-- DatagramReceiver
IDatagramReceiver ..> DatagramSession : 创建并托管

note right of L1
  唯一对外契约：
  * 只暴露 shared_ptr 门面 + 抽象接口
  * 实现全部 Pimpl 到 L2
  * 除 std::error_code 外不抛异常
end note

note right of L2
  全部定义在 src/ 下，公共头中仅
  "struct Impl;" 前向声明。
  hpp2plantuml 扫不到，需人工补齐。
end note

@enduml
